      "id": "claim_f3b980274e00425e88506edbf15c5900",
      "statement": "ADR-0001 (arranging real desktop icons through Win32 because a web wallpaper receives no clicks) and ADR-0003 (the search panel must be a service-owned native window) are marked superseded by ADR-0004, which replaces their shared 'web wallpaper host' premise with an Electron panel window whose declared hot zones receive clicks and keyboard; their reasoning is kept because it explains why the platform boundary moved.",
