      "statement": "archive/wallpaper-assets/ is a read-only freeze dated 2026-09-29 holding the three retired wallpaper trees — deck/ (source of the self-built AGENT DECK wallpaper that the deploy script pushed into Wallpaper Engine), patched/ (the TERMINAL 02 customization) and backup/original/ (the pristine upstream project used for rollback) — moved in unchanged from the former top-level deck/, patched/ and backup/ directories.",
