    {
      "id": "claim_cb23932ba6ea43eb9f20907b2f5f5afa",
      "statement": "The archive exists for provenance, not recovery (the commercial Decima Mono font, preview.gif and the original performance.layout.js could otherwise only be fetched again by re-downloading the Workshop item), and it is a dependency of nothing: it must not be modified, new work must not reference its fonts or assets, and deleting it is acceptable because git history retains it; the deck font binaries and the upstream editor's .history/ were never versioned anyway, while the renderer uses its own system monospace stack.",
