      "statement": "Two retired-era artifacts are still recognised by name in current code so the machine cleans up after itself: the Python watchdog's Startup shortcut qoder-deck-server-watchdog.lnk is deleted on every application run regardless of production identity, and the retired service's usage log under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\qoder-deck\\usage is copied once into the panel's userData — idempotently, only files inside the retention window, leaving the legacy directory in place — so the dock's usage-frequency ranking keeps its history.",
