      "statement": "The wallpaper is never asserted on even in acceptance testing: the battery proves the panel's transparency by sampling its transparent zone and requiring that the checker window beneath shows through (sample points filtered with WindowFromPoint so occluded points are not counted), and the 02-on-wallpaper screenshot is kept as a visual record only because a dynamic wallpaper differs frame by frame and carries no pixel assertion.",
